ut one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Hua is a student who loves plants, he plants some rare flowers in the school garden. Zhao Min really likes photography, she takes pictures of these flowers when she passes by the school garden. Zhang Wei is the school gardener, he sees Zhao Min taking pictures of the flowers without permission, but because he knows Zhao Min has a difficult family situation and photography is her only hobby, he does not stop her. When Li Hua finds out that someone takes pictures of his flowers and posts them on social media without permission, he starts asking people around him. In the end, Zhao Min finds out that the flowers belong to Li Hua and admits her behavior.\n\n[Question]\nWhat kind of emotions does Zhang Wei feel when he sees Zhao Min taking pictures of the flowers but does not stop her?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Wei possibly feels indifferent, because he thinks this is not his responsibility.\nB. Zhang Wei possibly feels satisfied, because he thinks Zhao Min's photography can showcase the beauty of the school garden.\nC. Zhang Wei possibly feels confused, because he is not sure whether he should intervene in student activities.\nD. Zhang Wei possibly feels conflicted and sympathetic, because he understands Zhao Min's predicament, but at the same time knows her actions are inappropriate.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af584ee9aa9dc5a833d3a6f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475246513,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:20:46","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"